1
00:01:43,110 --> 00:01:48,009
[When I Meet The Moon]

2
00:01:48,070 --> 00:01:50,990
[Episode 14]

3
00:01:51,009 --> 00:01:53,080
[Steal A Moment To Sip Wine Guesthouse]

4
00:01:51,979 --> 00:01:52,370
Okay.

5
00:01:52,370 --> 00:01:53,370
See you tomorrow.

6
00:01:54,380 --> 00:01:55,370
Here is your room key.

7
00:01:55,370 --> 00:01:55,759
Thank you.

8
00:01:55,759 --> 00:01:56,820
Please come again.

9
00:01:58,070 --> 00:01:58,920
Take care.

10
00:02:09,000 --> 00:02:09,660
Congsheng,

11
00:02:10,080 --> 00:02:12,060
why hasn't your Tangy arrived yet?

12
00:02:12,210 --> 00:02:13,470
She has something to do and will be late.

13
00:02:13,470 --> 00:02:14,270
What's wrong?

14
00:02:15,910 --> 00:02:16,710
Nothing.

15
00:02:16,750 --> 00:02:17,560
Nothing.

16
00:02:18,579 --> 00:02:19,579
You usually take every chance

17
00:02:19,579 --> 00:02:20,680
to lounge around.

18
00:02:20,970 --> 00:02:22,120
Why are you wandering around

19
00:02:22,120 --> 00:02:23,520
with a crutch today?

20
00:02:24,780 --> 00:02:25,560
I'm just afraid that you

21
00:02:25,560 --> 00:02:26,470
can't handle it alone,

22
00:02:26,470 --> 00:02:27,530
so I'm helping you.

23
00:02:28,579 --> 00:02:29,410
Fu Zhengchu,

24
00:02:29,520 --> 00:02:30,620
the way you care about others

25
00:02:30,620 --> 00:02:31,710
is quite scary.

26
00:02:32,579 --> 00:02:33,410
He who is overly attentive

27
00:02:33,410 --> 00:02:34,360
usually has an ulterior motive.

28
00:02:34,360 --> 00:02:36,290
Just tell me if you need something.

29
00:02:36,810 --> 00:02:37,579
Nothing.

30
00:02:37,579 --> 00:02:39,620
I just stayed in the room

31
00:02:39,620 --> 00:02:40,150
for too long

32
00:02:40,150 --> 00:02:41,210
and came out to stretch.

33
00:02:41,210 --> 00:02:42,360
You have too much free time, right?

34
00:02:42,360 --> 00:02:43,210
Then I'll leave this to you.

35
00:02:43,210 --> 00:02:44,710
I happen to have something
to do and need to go out.

36
00:02:44,710 --> 00:02:45,079
Wait, don't go.

37
00:02:45,079 --> 00:02:45,970
I'm on a crutch.

38
00:02:45,970 --> 00:02:47,500
I'll just be in the way here.

39
00:02:47,750 --> 00:02:48,500
Xia.

40
00:02:49,590 --> 00:02:50,870
Sorry, I'm late.

41
00:02:50,870 --> 00:02:51,680
Tangy, you're here.

42
00:02:51,680 --> 00:02:52,620
Then I'll leave this to you.

43
00:02:52,620 --> 00:02:53,620
I happen to have something
to do and need to go out.

44
00:02:53,620 --> 00:02:54,310
Go ahead.

45
00:03:02,970 --> 00:03:04,630
You were late today, you know.

46
00:03:04,680 --> 00:03:06,120
Although my sister didn't scold you,

47
00:03:06,120 --> 00:03:07,280
I still have to remind you

48
00:03:07,280 --> 00:03:08,610
not to be late next time.

49
00:03:08,680 --> 00:03:10,150
Your sister owns the guesthouse.

50
00:03:10,150 --> 00:03:11,810
I am your sister's employee.

51
00:03:11,910 --> 00:03:13,520
What does it have to do with you?

52
00:03:13,520 --> 00:03:14,370
What's wrong with you today?

53
00:03:14,370 --> 00:03:14,810
Why are you

54
00:03:14,810 --> 00:03:16,020
so fired up?

55
00:03:16,210 --> 00:03:17,250
Who bullied you?

56
00:03:25,520 --> 00:03:27,120
My leg hurts.

57
00:03:27,120 --> 00:03:28,650
Don't you care about it?

58
00:03:28,970 --> 00:03:30,500
What's there to care about?

59
00:03:30,680 --> 00:03:31,710
I don't think it

60
00:03:31,710 --> 00:03:32,910
cramps your fun.

61
00:03:33,310 --> 00:03:35,460
This is called having a good mindset.

62
00:03:36,810 --> 00:03:37,620
With a pretty girl by your side,

63
00:03:37,620 --> 00:03:39,480
of course you have a good mindset.

64
00:03:40,370 --> 00:03:41,300
What did you say?

65
00:03:46,390 --> 00:03:47,360
Is there any bone soup

66
00:03:47,360 --> 00:03:48,650
tonight?

67
00:03:50,820 --> 00:03:51,760
No bones,

68
00:03:52,210 --> 00:03:53,520
but I have a fist.

69
00:03:53,620 --> 00:03:54,410
Want a taste?

70
00:04:03,050 --> 00:04:04,250
Why did she snap at me?

71
00:04:49,120 --> 00:04:50,450
How about sitting here?

72
00:04:51,920 --> 00:04:52,770
I'll go order.

73
00:04:59,420 --> 00:05:00,680
Hello. Two lattes

74
00:05:01,220 --> 00:05:02,420
and two matcha cakes.

75
00:05:03,000 --> 00:05:03,690
Shize,

76
00:05:03,810 --> 00:05:04,660
you're back.

77
00:05:04,930 --> 00:05:05,810
Is there anything you need to do

78
00:05:05,810 --> 00:05:07,010
back at school today?

79
00:05:08,180 --> 00:05:10,440
I have a speech at school this afternoon.

80
00:05:11,360 --> 00:05:13,740
Come back and visit often
when you have time.

81
00:05:13,740 --> 00:05:15,240
To see the professors and classmates.

82
00:05:15,240 --> 00:05:15,720
Yes.

83
00:05:16,770 --> 00:05:17,750
Hello.

84
00:05:18,000 --> 00:05:18,920
Let's go over there first.

85
00:05:18,920 --> 00:05:19,860
We meet again.

86
00:05:20,010 --> 00:05:21,190
This seat is taken.

87
00:05:22,220 --> 00:05:23,770
But no one is here right now.

88
00:05:27,770 --> 00:05:28,750
This is my seat.

89
00:05:30,250 --> 00:05:31,050
Senior Fu.

90
00:05:31,270 --> 00:05:32,150
Hello, hello.

91
00:05:33,770 --> 00:05:34,770
My name is Chen Lirong.

92
00:05:34,770 --> 00:05:36,120
I'm a joint PhD student
under the supervision of

93
00:05:36,120 --> 00:05:37,580
Professors Shi and Xiang.

94
00:05:42,070 --> 00:05:42,870
Senior Fu,

95
00:05:43,370 --> 00:05:44,220
there's another seat here.

96
00:05:44,220 --> 00:05:45,420
I'll just sit here...

97
00:06:04,220 --> 00:06:05,010
Well,

98
00:06:05,450 --> 00:06:07,180
work ends tomorrow.

99
00:06:07,660 --> 00:06:09,680
When is your flight?

100
00:06:10,420 --> 00:06:11,220
Wednesday.

101
00:06:13,510 --> 00:06:14,510
I booked mine too.

102
00:06:15,060 --> 00:06:16,010
For Thursday.

103
00:06:27,690 --> 00:06:29,340
What time is your flight?

104
00:06:32,220 --> 00:06:34,120
6:15 AM.

105
00:06:39,220 --> 00:06:41,220
The airport is really far from here.

106
00:06:41,270 --> 00:06:42,600
How about I drop you off?

107
00:06:55,220 --> 00:06:56,330
Hello, everyone, I am

108
00:06:55,850 --> 00:06:59,710
[Xifu University
of Science and Technology]

109
00:06:56,330 --> 00:06:57,650
Fu Shize from EAW.

110
00:06:57,920 --> 00:06:59,680
It's an honor to be here at XUST

111
00:07:00,240 --> 00:07:01,300
to introduce VR

112
00:07:01,520 --> 00:07:03,650
and help everyone learn more about it.

113
00:07:03,910 --> 00:07:06,050
Compared to traditional immersive spaces,

114
00:07:06,050 --> 00:07:07,080
large-scale VR has advantages

115
00:07:07,080 --> 00:07:09,740
such as a high degree of freedom
in interaction,

116
00:07:09,810 --> 00:07:10,810
diverse gameplay,

117
00:07:10,810 --> 00:07:11,870
deep immersion,

118
00:07:12,070 --> 00:07:13,920
and social interaction.

119
00:07:14,220 --> 00:07:16,180
We can break the barriers

120
00:07:16,420 --> 00:07:18,350
of physical space through actions

121
00:07:18,480 --> 00:07:20,420
such as walking and grabbing.

122
00:07:20,690 --> 00:07:22,060
Take this VR headset

123
00:07:22,340 --> 00:07:23,670
in my hand as an example.

124
00:07:24,500 --> 00:07:25,800
We've incorporated

125
00:07:26,130 --> 00:07:27,130
real-time kinematic

126
00:07:27,130 --> 00:07:28,240
GPS technology into it.

127
00:07:28,240 --> 00:07:29,300
Hello, beautiful.

128
00:07:33,260 --> 00:07:33,900
Excuse me.

129
00:07:33,930 --> 00:07:35,530
I need to get some documents.

130
00:07:37,200 --> 00:07:38,080
Your boyfriend

131
00:07:38,560 --> 00:07:40,560
is quite a prominent figure at XUST.

132
00:07:41,120 --> 00:07:41,890
Want to hear about

133
00:07:41,890 --> 00:07:42,720
some of the things

134
00:07:42,720 --> 00:07:43,920
he's done in the past?

135
00:07:44,890 --> 00:07:45,810
Whatever it is about him,

136
00:07:45,810 --> 00:07:47,270
I don't need you to tell me.

137
00:07:47,420 --> 00:07:48,190
If he wants to talk about it,

138
00:07:48,190 --> 00:07:49,520
he will tell me himself.

139
00:07:55,300 --> 00:07:56,000
Excuse me.

140
00:08:37,740 --> 00:08:38,480
Sorry

141
00:08:38,510 --> 00:08:39,640
to keep you waiting.

142
00:08:40,320 --> 00:08:41,250
Let's continue.

143
00:08:42,360 --> 00:08:43,720
On our helmet

144
00:08:43,909 --> 00:08:45,120
and the controllers,

145
00:08:45,290 --> 00:08:46,650
there are over 70

146
00:08:46,650 --> 00:08:48,110
photosensitive sensors.

147
00:08:48,510 --> 00:08:49,460
As the laser sweeps

148
00:08:49,460 --> 00:08:50,600
across the sensors,

149
00:08:51,050 --> 00:08:51,820
we can use

150
00:08:51,820 --> 00:08:52,860
the positions of the sensors

151
00:08:52,860 --> 00:08:54,250
and the controllers,

152
00:08:54,910 --> 00:08:57,250
along with the laser's reach...

153
00:09:39,860 --> 00:09:41,060
Let me give you a ride.

154
00:09:41,100 --> 00:09:42,230
My car is over there.

155
00:09:42,460 --> 00:09:43,250
No need.

156
00:09:43,510 --> 00:09:44,910
My ride is arriving soon.

157
00:09:55,220 --> 00:09:56,020
Wait a minute.

158
00:10:07,320 --> 00:10:08,110
I'm leaving.

159
00:10:34,410 --> 00:10:35,340
When I see you,

160
00:10:35,910 --> 00:10:37,860
it's like seeing the moon.

161
00:11:08,440 --> 00:11:09,100
Li.

162
00:11:10,130 --> 00:11:11,870
I warmed some milk for you.

163
00:11:12,030 --> 00:11:13,360
Drink it while it's hot.

164
00:11:15,100 --> 00:11:16,410
Did you poison me?

165
00:11:16,910 --> 00:11:18,080
How could I?

166
00:11:18,080 --> 00:11:19,390
Since you're leaving,

167
00:11:19,390 --> 00:11:21,390
I thought I'd come check on you.

168
00:11:22,890 --> 00:11:25,010
Okay, thanks.

169
00:11:31,720 --> 00:11:33,410
You've shown you care,

170
00:11:33,410 --> 00:11:34,910
and I drank the milk.

171
00:11:34,910 --> 00:11:35,510
If there's nothing else,

172
00:11:35,510 --> 00:11:36,720
you can leave now.

173
00:11:37,740 --> 00:11:38,700
Look at you.

174
00:11:38,700 --> 00:11:40,080
You're not sleeping anyway.

175
00:11:40,080 --> 00:11:40,700
Just let me stay here

176
00:11:40,700 --> 00:11:41,390
for a while.

177
00:11:41,390 --> 00:11:42,030
Fine.

178
00:11:42,030 --> 00:11:43,250
Stay if you want.

179
00:12:22,840 --> 00:12:24,240
Do you have hemorrhoids?

180
00:12:24,770 --> 00:12:25,720
No.

181
00:12:27,120 --> 00:12:27,870
It's fine.

182
00:12:27,870 --> 00:12:29,130
Kids at your age

183
00:12:29,130 --> 00:12:30,370
sit and study all day.

184
00:12:30,370 --> 00:12:32,080
It's normal to have this problem.

185
00:12:32,080 --> 00:12:34,320
Just walk more every day,

186
00:12:34,370 --> 00:12:35,170
drink more water,

187
00:12:35,170 --> 00:12:36,410
and cut back on those snacks
that are considered too heaty.

188
00:12:36,410 --> 00:12:37,050
unhealthy snacks.

189
00:12:37,050 --> 00:12:38,200
I really don't.

190
00:12:41,130 --> 00:12:41,940
I know.

191
00:12:42,220 --> 00:12:42,910
For the next few days,

192
00:12:42,910 --> 00:12:44,620
just try to have
a bowel movement regularly.

193
00:12:44,620 --> 00:12:45,340
If you can't,

194
00:12:45,340 --> 00:12:46,740
don't force it.

195
00:12:47,030 --> 00:12:48,080
Let's see how things go
over the next few days.

196
00:12:48,080 --> 00:12:49,720
If it doesn't work,
ask Mom to take you to the hospital.

197
00:12:49,720 --> 00:12:50,220
I know.

198
00:12:50,480 --> 00:12:51,130
I know.

199
00:12:51,620 --> 00:12:53,420
Do you have anything else to say?

200
00:12:54,240 --> 00:12:56,170
I'm leaving tomorrow.

201
00:12:56,530 --> 00:12:57,930
Be good at home.

202
00:12:57,950 --> 00:12:59,550
Don't make Mom and Dad angry.

203
00:13:02,190 --> 00:13:02,990
Oh, right, Li.

204
00:13:05,250 --> 00:13:06,000
Wait for me.

205
00:13:18,370 --> 00:13:19,240
Don't even think about it.

206
00:13:19,240 --> 00:13:20,130
I have no money.

207
00:13:20,390 --> 00:13:21,910
Am I that kind of person?

208
00:13:22,530 --> 00:13:24,440
I guess I've misjudged you.

209
00:13:24,840 --> 00:13:25,870
Do you still remember

210
00:13:25,870 --> 00:13:28,530
that 302.5 yuan?

211
00:13:28,720 --> 00:13:29,860
Do you remember?

212
00:13:29,880 --> 00:13:30,880
You owe me.

213
00:13:35,200 --> 00:13:35,910
Yes.

214
00:13:39,840 --> 00:13:41,170
I transferred it to you.

215
00:13:46,080 --> 00:13:47,680
You call this paying me back?

216
00:13:48,770 --> 00:13:49,960
I don't have money.

217
00:13:49,960 --> 00:13:51,690
I can only pay in installments.

218
00:13:51,880 --> 00:13:53,050
But I promise I'll transfer

219
00:13:53,050 --> 00:13:54,940
2.5 yuan to you

220
00:13:55,030 --> 00:13:56,530
on the first of every month.

221
00:13:56,530 --> 00:13:57,550
Sooner or later,

222
00:13:57,700 --> 00:13:59,230
I'll definitely pay it off.

223
00:14:00,820 --> 00:14:01,720
300 yuan,

224
00:14:01,820 --> 00:14:03,220
and you're paying it over 10 years?

225
00:14:03,220 --> 00:14:04,580
Why don't you wait until my 80th birthday

226
00:14:04,580 --> 00:14:05,530
to pay me back?

227
00:14:06,440 --> 00:14:07,440
Not necessarily.

228
00:14:07,750 --> 00:14:08,770
Maybe one day,

229
00:14:08,770 --> 00:14:10,360
when my financial situation

230
00:14:10,360 --> 00:14:11,510
is better,

231
00:14:11,670 --> 00:14:12,340
I...

232
00:14:13,180 --> 00:14:13,920
Go on.

233
00:14:13,940 --> 00:14:14,810
I'm recording.

234
00:14:15,270 --> 00:14:17,630
I could pay you back all at once.

235
00:14:18,410 --> 00:14:19,220
Okay.

236
00:14:19,220 --> 00:14:20,510
I'm counting on you.

237
00:14:23,480 --> 00:14:24,530
So what is it?

238
00:14:25,670 --> 00:14:27,170
I just want you

239
00:14:27,510 --> 00:14:29,510
to bring something to a friend for me.

240
00:14:29,510 --> 00:14:30,240
Who is it for?

241
00:14:30,390 --> 00:14:31,110
The girl

242
00:14:31,140 --> 00:14:32,900
you saw the other day.

243
00:14:33,910 --> 00:14:35,910
Her brother went to work in Nanwu,

244
00:14:36,010 --> 00:14:37,770
and she transferred there too.

245
00:14:39,080 --> 00:14:40,550
Why don't you mail it to her?

246
00:14:40,550 --> 00:14:42,290
I glued it myself.

247
00:14:42,290 --> 00:14:44,490
I'm afraid it'll fall apart if I mail it.

248
00:14:47,150 --> 00:14:48,010
Li,

249
00:14:48,010 --> 00:14:49,410
please.

250
00:14:49,410 --> 00:14:50,120
Wait,

251
00:14:50,320 --> 00:14:51,850
you're not dating, are you?

252
00:14:51,870 --> 00:14:52,980
I'm really not.

253
00:14:53,240 --> 00:14:54,770
We are just good friends.

254
00:14:54,770 --> 00:14:55,770
Pure friendship.

255
00:14:57,170 --> 00:14:57,960
But

256
00:14:58,700 --> 00:15:00,000
don't tell Mom and Dad.

257
00:15:00,170 --> 00:15:01,700
I'm afraid Dad will beat me.

258
00:15:02,480 --> 00:15:03,750
Don't date too early.

259
00:15:05,120 --> 00:15:06,220
Got it.

260
00:15:06,390 --> 00:15:07,320
I love studying.

261
00:15:07,320 --> 00:15:08,770
Studying makes me happy.

262
00:15:10,720 --> 00:15:11,850
I'll think about it.

263
00:15:12,790 --> 00:15:13,250
But are you

264
00:15:13,250 --> 00:15:14,870
asking me to meet her and give it to her?

265
00:15:14,870 --> 00:15:15,960
I don't want to go.

266
00:15:16,870 --> 00:15:18,250
Please, Yun Li.

267
00:15:18,250 --> 00:15:19,370
Please.

268
00:15:19,370 --> 00:15:20,320
I stayed up for several nights

269
00:15:20,320 --> 00:15:21,410
to make it.

270
00:15:22,100 --> 00:15:22,840
Fine.

271
00:15:22,840 --> 00:15:24,240
Bring it here.

272
00:15:24,870 --> 00:15:25,670
Really?

273
00:15:26,210 --> 00:15:27,130
Wait for me here.

274
00:15:27,130 --> 00:15:28,460
Wait for me. Wait for me.

275
00:15:32,840 --> 00:15:34,940
Why are we so alike?

276
00:16:07,960 --> 00:16:09,030
Have a nice trip.

277
00:16:11,290 --> 00:16:12,220
-Hello.
-Hello.

278
00:16:13,050 --> 00:16:13,860
Just a moment.

279
00:16:21,960 --> 00:16:23,050
Have a nice trip.

280
00:16:23,050 --> 00:16:23,750
Thank you.

281
00:16:29,740 --> 00:16:31,290
My flight was canceled,

282
00:16:31,290 --> 00:16:32,630
so I changed to this one.

283
00:16:34,970 --> 00:16:36,000
Why don't you wait for me?

284
00:16:36,000 --> 00:16:37,000
I'll check in too.

285
00:16:41,440 --> 00:16:42,000
Hello.

286
00:16:42,000 --> 00:16:42,740
Hello.

287
00:16:43,130 --> 00:16:44,340
I'm friends

288
00:16:44,340 --> 00:16:45,000
with the gentleman who was just here.

289
00:16:45,000 --> 00:16:46,000
His name is Fu Shize.

290
00:16:46,000 --> 00:16:47,390
Can I sit with him?

291
00:16:47,700 --> 00:16:48,600
You want the seat

292
00:16:48,600 --> 00:16:50,250
next to this gentleman, right?

293
00:16:50,250 --> 00:16:51,050
Just a moment.

294
00:17:22,160 --> 00:17:23,250
If you can see it,

295
00:17:23,530 --> 00:17:24,460
I can see it too.

296
