426
00:25:39,500 --> 00:25:40,030
Bye-bye.

427
00:25:40,030 --> 00:25:40,570
Bye-bye.

428
00:25:43,350 --> 00:25:44,330
What's going on?

429
00:25:44,330 --> 00:25:45,730
