437
00:25:55,350 --> 00:25:56,810
When you were being slandered recently,

438
00:25:56,810 --> 00:25:58,070
I even spoke up for you.

439
00:25:58,280 --> 00:25:59,090
Thank you.

440
00:26:02,180 --> 00:26:02,780
Tingting.

441
00:26:03,440 --> 00:26:04,000
Tingting.

442
00:26:04,000 --> 00:26:04,740
Eat this.

443
00:26:04,810 --> 00:26:05,410
Thank you.

444
00:26:05,790 --> 00:26:06,480
And yours.

445
00:26:06,530 --> 00:26:07,290
Thank you.

446
00:26:07,500 --> 00:26:08,900
