492
00:29:53,900 --> 00:29:54,580
Bye-bye.

493
00:29:54,610 --> 00:29:55,380
I'm leaving, Yun Li.

494
00:29:55,380 --> 00:29:56,110
Bye-bye.

495
00:30:09,990 --> 00:30:12,120
