499
00:30:51,750 --> 00:30:53,810
Let's have dinner together tonight.

500
00:31:06,060 --> 00:31:06,750
Mm.

501
00:31:26,480 --> 00:31:28,220
Since you came back from Xifu,

502
00:31:28,250 --> 00:31:30,650
