541
00:33:00,460 --> 00:33:01,460
What is it?

542
00:33:03,660 --> 00:33:06,260
Didn't he take a leave of absence
from college?

543
00:33:07,550 --> 00:33:08,920
He did that because

544
00:33:08,920 --> 00:33:10,480
