546
00:33:11,570 --> 00:33:12,570
But as for the specific reasons,

547
00:33:12,570 --> 00:33:13,610
none of us know.

548
00:33:14,570 --> 00:33:16,150
Xia meant that her uncle

549
00:33:16,180 --> 00:33:17,850
wasn't like this before.

550
00:33:17,850 --> 00:33:18,750
wasn't like this.

551
00:33:18,750 --> 00:33:20,210
Because of this incident,

552
00:33:21,110 --> 00:33:22,510
