00:34:35,380 --> 00:34:37,110
What happened between you two?

590
00:34:37,360 --> 00:34:38,739
I just feel that

591
00:34:39,550 --> 00:34:40,960
he has so many

592
00:34:40,960 --> 00:34:42,820
young and pretty girls around him.

593
00:34:42,820 --> 00:34:44,150
They are the same age.

594
00:34:45,050 --> 00:34:46,960
Why should I even get involved?

595
00:34:49,980 --> 00:34:51,360
You don't have a fever.

596
00:34:51,480 --> 00:34:53,010
Why are you talking nonsense?

597
00:34:53,010 --> 00:34:54,800
I'm serious.

598
00:34:58,960 --> 00:35:00,010
Do you know why

599
00:35:00,010 --> 00:35:00,980
I don't want others to know

600
00:35:00,980 --> 00:35:03,240
about my relationship with Fu Zhengchu?

601
00:35:05,550 --> 00:35:06,480
Some say

602
00:35:07,510 --> 00:35:09,320
the first thing you feel
when you like someone

603
00:35:09,320 --> 00:35:10,280
is insecurity.

604
00:35:11,570 --> 00:35:13,430
I think that's exactly how I feel.

605
00:35:14,610 --> 00:35:15,280
I feel that

606
00:35:15,280 --> 00:35:16,920
I'm a few years older than him.

607
00:35:16,920 --> 00:35:17,780
What about him?

608
00:35:18,210 --> 00:35:19,210
He's young,

609
00:35:19,210 --> 00:35:19,980
handsome,

610
00:35:19,980 --> 00:35:21,150
and can skateboard.

611
00:35:21,150 --> 00:35:21,650
Everything about him

612
00:35:21,650 --> 00:35:23,260
is very attractive to girls.

613
00:35:26,550 --> 00:35:27,980
When I'm with him,

614
00:35:28,570 --> 00:35:31,170
I always feel like
I'm taking advantage of him.

615
00:35:32,070 --> 00:35:32,760
Tangy,

616
00:35:32,920 --> 00:35:34,240
because you like him,

617
00:35:34,270 --> 00:35:36,080
you only see the good in him.

618
00:35:36,240 --> 00:35:37,030
I actually think

619
00:35:37,030 --> 00:35:38,620
you are shining.

620
00:35:38,650 --> 00:35:40,170
In the eyes of someone who likes you,

621
00:35:40,170 --> 00:35:41,920
you are shining.

622
00:35:45,280 --> 00:35:46,360
Besides, you're only

623
00:35:46,360 --> 00:35:47,820
a few years older than him.

624
00:35:48,260 --> 00:35:49,570
Why do you overthink it

625
00:35:49,940 --> 00:35:52,270
and bring yourself unnecessary trouble?

626
00:35:53,380 --> 00:35:54,260
Maybe Fu Zhengchu

627
00:35:54,260 --> 00:35:55,590
just likes older girls.

628
00:35:55,880 --> 00:35:56,980
Fu Zhengchu likes

629
00:35:56,980 --> 00:35:58,510
girls younger than him.

630
00:36:00,510 --> 00:36:01,670
I've seen him several times

631
00:36:01,670 --> 00:36:03,730
chatting happily with junior girls.

632
00:36:06,150 --> 00:36:07,050
Forget it.

633
00:36:08,210 --> 00:36:09,790
I've said what I needed to say

634
00:36:09,790 --> 00:36:11,810
and done what I needed to do.

635
00:36:13,590 --> 00:36:14,790
I should just give up.

636
00:36:17,360 --> 00:36:17,980
Alright.

637
00:36:18,650 --> 00:36:21,300
Whether you keep going or give up,

638
00:36:21,460 --> 00:36:22,570
I support you.

639
00:36:22,710 --> 00:36:24,510
But one thing is very important.

640
00:36:24,760 --> 00:36:26,890
You can't talk yourself down anymore.

641
00:36:28,170 --> 00:36:30,070
Our Tangy is incredibly beautiful,

642
00:36:30,070 --> 00:36:31,050
a young and gorgeous woman.

643
00:36:31,050 --> 00:36:31,710
If he doesn't like you,

644
00:36:31,710 --> 00:36:32,880
he's the one with bad taste.

645
00:36:32,880 --> 00:36:34,140
It's not your problem.

646
00:36:37,650 --> 00:36:38,900
Why does this sound

647
00:36:38,900 --> 00:36:40,170
so familiar?

648
00:36:42,260 --> 00:36:43,520
Fu Shize has bad taste.

649
00:36:45,430 --> 00:36:47,290
Fu Zhengchu has even worse taste.

650
00:36:47,960 --> 00:36:49,360
Only you have good taste.

651
00:36:51,360 --> 00:36:52,070
Exactly.

652
00:36:55,150 --> 00:36:55,880
Alright.

653
00:36:55,880 --> 00:36:57,070
You can stop here.

654
00:36:57,070 --> 00:36:58,330
I'll take the bus back.

655
00:36:58,610 --> 00:37:00,460
Remember to be happy.

656
00:37:00,480 --> 00:37:01,650
Got it.

657
00:37:02,750 --> 00:37:03,640
Good luck with Fu Shize.

658
00:37:03,640 --> 00:37:04,870
You can do it!

659
00:37:05,530 --> 00:37:06,500
Okay.

660
00:37:08,760 --> 00:37:10,570
But I have to go back to school soon

661
00:37:10,570 --> 00:37:11,770
to prepare for exams.

662
00:37:12,090 --> 00:37:13,190
I probably won't see him

663
00:37:13,190 --> 00:37:14,320
for a while.

664
00:37:14,960 --> 00:37:16,920
Absence makes the heart grow fonder.

665
00:37:16,920 --> 00:37:17,760
You can do it.

666
00:37:20,360 --> 00:37:21,730
Just go.

667
00:37:22,230 --> 00:37:22,960
I'm leaving.

668
00:37:29,240 --> 00:37:31,630
[Person on Duty: Tang Lin]

669
00:37:46,630 --> 00:37:47,280
Hello?

670
00:37:47,550 --> 00:37:48,610
What are you doing?

671
00:37:48,650 --> 00:37:49,480
Why haven't I seen you

672
00:37:49,480 --> 00:37:50,610
all day?

673
00:37:50,710 --> 00:37:51,510
I'm on leave.

674
00:37:52,010 --> 00:37:52,820
On leave?

675
00:37:53,460 --> 00:37:54,170
Why didn't you

676
00:37:54,170 --> 00:37:55,320
tell me?

677
00:37:55,360 --> 00:37:57,010
Why should I tell you?

678
00:37:57,110 --> 00:37:58,070
Who are you?

679
00:37:58,740 --> 00:38:01,130
Then what time are you coming tomorrow?

680
00:38:01,280 --> 00:38:02,070
I don't know.

681
00:38:02,980 --> 00:38:03,710
Well,

682
00:38:03,710 --> 00:38:05,280
how many days of leave did you take?

683
00:38:05,280 --> 00:38:06,610
Does it concern you?

684
00:38:07,170 --> 00:38:07,860
If you have something to say, say it.

685
00:38:07,860 --> 00:38:08,610
If not, I'm hanging up.

686
00:38:08,610 --> 00:38:09,030
Don't.

687
00:38:09,960 --> 00:38:10,530
I do.

688
00:38:11,110 --> 00:38:12,780
I want to drink bone soup.

689
00:38:12,780 --> 00:38:13,460
I don't have time.

690
00:38:13,460 --> 00:38:14,320
I'm hanging up.

691
00:38:14,730 --> 00:38:15,340
Tang Lin!

692
00:38:18,960 --> 00:38:20,890
See you at the usual place tonight.

693
00:38:21,420 --> 00:38:22,210
No matter how late,

694
00:38:22,210 --> 00:38:23,270
I will wait for you.

695
00:38:24,300 --> 00:38:25,230
You must come.

696
00:38:40,090 --> 00:38:40,940
Emergency.

697
00:38:41,050 --> 00:38:42,650
Which of you guys is at school?

698
00:38:42,650 --> 00:38:43,450
What's wrong?

699
00:38:43,630 --> 00:38:44,900
Mr. Zhang is crazy.

700
00:38:45,010 --> 00:38:46,780
He suddenly wants the test data
by tomorrow.

701
00:38:46,780 --> 00:38:48,190
The data is in the lab.

702
00:38:48,460 --> 00:38:49,510
Who has time to get it

703
00:38:49,510 --> 00:38:50,700
and bring it to the classroom
tomorrow morning?

704
00:38:50,700 --> 00:38:51,980
Undressed. Don't disturb.

705
00:38:51,980 --> 00:38:53,110
I'm not in the dorm today.

706
00:38:53,110 --> 00:38:54,710
I'm on the night shift today.

707
00:38:57,570 --> 00:38:58,440
I'll go.

708
00:38:58,610 --> 00:38:59,410
It's on my way.

709
00:39:35,320 --> 00:39:36,360
No way.

710
00:39:45,670 --> 00:39:46,600
Is anyone there?

711
00:39:47,380 --> 00:39:48,530
Can anyone hear me?

712
00:39:57,660 --> 00:40:00,290
[NUST Elevator Emergency Response
Campus Safety Hotline (24/7)]

713
00:40:05,550 --> 00:40:08,170
Sorry, the number you dialed...

714
00:40:12,690 --> 00:40:13,730
Is anyone there?

715
00:40:14,260 --> 00:40:15,300
Don't worry.

716
00:40:15,360 --> 00:40:16,890
We'll handle it right away.

717
00:40:18,740 --> 00:40:20,320
[What should we do in a trapped lift?]

718
00:40:20,980 --> 00:40:22,610
Watch out for the gap
between the elevator and the shaft wall.

719
00:40:22,610 --> 00:40:23,720
An old lady wasn't paying attention,

720
00:40:23,720 --> 00:40:24,960
ran out as soon as the door opened,

721
00:40:24,960 --> 00:40:25,730
and got stuck in the gap

722
00:40:25,730 --> 00:40:26,740
between the elevator car
and the shaft wall.

723
00:40:26,740 --> 00:40:28,160
She starved to death.

724
00:40:30,780 --> 00:40:32,360
A falling elevator isn't scary.

725
00:40:32,360 --> 00:40:34,380
The scary part is it shooting upward.

726
00:40:34,380 --> 00:40:36,340
Anyone who has done
elevator maintenance knows

727
00:40:36,340 --> 00:40:38,420
that inspection is just basic maintenance.

728
00:40:38,420 --> 00:40:39,610
If something really happens,

729
00:40:39,610 --> 00:40:41,270
you can only pray for the best.

730
00:40:59,300 --> 00:41:00,880
I'm trapped in the elevator.
